Welcome to FoxoOS 1.0 (Trixie)
Debian GNU/Linux 13 base | init: sysvinit-core | services: OpenRC

  * package management: apt / dpkg (Debian repositories)
  * service management: rc-service, rc-update, rc-status
  * reboot / shutdown:   reboot, poweroff, shutdown -r now / -h now

Debian compatibility is kept via /etc/debian_version and ID_LIKE=debian.
